{"name":"Raven","hex":"#0b0b0b","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Raven","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname.","A unisex given name.\nA female given name from English, usually for a girl with raven hair, used since the 1970s.\n\nA male given name."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Raven"}],"entries":[{"title":"Raven","blocks":[{"text":"A raven is any of several large-bodied passerine bird species in the genus Corvus. These species do not form a single taxonomic group within the genus. There is no consistent distinction between crows and ravens; the two names are assigned to different species mainly by size."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/3782_Common_Raven_in_flight.jpg/330px-3782_Common_Raven_in_flight.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raven"},{"title":"Raven (wrestler)","blocks":[{"text":"Scott Levy, also known as Raven, is an American professional wrestler who historically competed for Extreme Championship Wrestling (ECW). Besides ECW, he is best known for his appearances with other professional wrestling promotions such as World Championship Wrestling (WCW), the World Wrestling Federation (WWF) / World Wrestling Entertainment (WWE) and NWA Total Nonstop Action (TNA)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Raven_2025_cropped.jpg/330px-Raven_2025_cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raven_(wrestler)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Ravaged_Raven_in_Flight.jpg/120px-Ravaged_Raven_in_Flight.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Ravaged_Raven_in_Flight.jpg/250px-Ravaged_Raven_in_Flight.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm